e-specific configuration** — credentials (NTRIP, etc.), network host mappings, startup scripts from the site layer.\n8. **Adopt git-bug for field agents** — enable local issue tracking on gabby so agents can work without GitHub write access. Sync to Forgejo; bridge to GitHub when connectivity allows.\n9. **Verification and deployment guide** — end-to-end test, then distill agent logs into a reusable deployment guide.\n\n## Approach\n\nThis deployment will be done interactively — agents and human working together, with agents keeping detailed logs of what was done at each step. These logs will later be used to generate a reusable deployment guide.\n\n## Sub-Issues\n\n| # | Task | Repo | Status |\n|---|------|------|--------|\n| | Sync workspace repos to gitcloud | CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11 (private) | |\n| | Boat manifest with gitcloud URLs | unh_echoboats_project11 (public) | |\n| | Connect gabby to VPN and gitcloud | CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11 (private) | |\n| | Install ROS 2 Jazzy on gabby | unh_echoboats_project11 (public) | |\n| | Bootstrap and build workspace on gabby | unh_echoboats_project11 (public) | |\n| #13 | Create bizzyboat_project11 package | unh_echoboats_project11 (public) | open |\n| | Site-specific configuration | CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11 (private) | |\n| | Git-bug and offline agent workflow | unh_echoboats_project11 (public) | |\n| | Deployment guide | unh_echoboats_project11 (public) | |\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.6`","files":null},{"type":6,"timestamp":1774534534,"nonce":"0TOr4/MXgDySbvskzEpfafSBhYs=","metadata":{"github-id":"UCE_lAHOK4fCvM73ASdjzq1JVMU"},"target":"2be8a3b8e52077bc47250f17471298a9d350fe576e5e79dd38796636bbf64324","message":"## Summary\n\nDeploy the ros2_agent_workspace on BizzyBoat's robot computer (gabby, Neousys Nuvo 9160GC) starting from a fresh Ubuntu 24.04 Server install.\n\ngabby will run the ROS 2 autonomy stack using a boat-specific manifest from this repo (`unh_echoboats_proj