ssed\n4. **udev rules** (#26) — stable USB symlinks for CubeOrange/Arduino\n5. **Site-specific config** (CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11#6) — NTRIP credentials ([CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11#10](https://github.com/CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11/issues/10)), startup scripts\n6. **Nvidia driver or nouveau blacklist** on gabby — GPU spamming errors in syslog\n7. **Operator station manifest** (CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11#11) — resolve missing `molab_hardware`\n8. **Deployment guide** (#18) — distill session logs into reusable guide (last)\n\n### Discovered Issues\n\n| Issue | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| [ros2_agent_workspace#429](https://github.com/rolker/ros2_agent_workspace/issues/429) | Missing rosdep step in `make build` |\n| [ros2_agent_workspace#430](https://github.com/rolker/ros2_agent_workspace/issues/430) | Manifest lint tool (prevent Gazebo on robots) |\n| [ben_project11#12](https://github.com/rolker/ben_project11/issues/12) | nav2_bringup pulling in Gazebo |\n| [seafloor_echoboat_project11#4](https://github.com/rolker/seafloor_echoboat_project11/issues/4) | nav2_bringup pulling in Gazebo |\n\n### Infrastructure Summary\n\n- **Networking**: Dual-path connectivity — WiFi bridge (~2ms) + WireGuard VPN (~37ms), NETMAP verified both directions, hierarchical DNS (`.p11.lan`)\n- **Build**: All 5 layers built on gabby (underlay, core, platforms, sensors, site) — 394 ROS 2 packages\n- **Hardware verified**: CubeOrange FCU via mavros, 4× OAK-1 PoE cameras detected, Arduino winch controller present\n- **Known junk**: Gazebo installed on gabby (~900 MB) via nav2_bringup dependency chain — clean up later\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context)`","files":null},{"type":4,"timestamp":1775673453,"nonce":"VcdpL88ymmK9Inauv3PBKGpEyy8=","metadata":{"github-id":"CE_lADOK4fCvM73ASdjzwAAAAWo0BzV"},"status":2}]}